是妩媚动人的，她妩媚的看着唐小虾，居然让唐小虾心中有如有一只小鹿在乱撞一样，脸微微的红了。这样的突发状况是唐小虾没有想到的，他这时已经走到了那老头的身后，此种情景下居然淡去了想找老头麻烦的念头，他看着那对男女觉得心有点虚，他想离开这里，心想这对男女看起来像是来找这老头麻烦的，多一事不如少一事，他准备离开了。那老头将头转了过来，他对唐小虾笑了，唐小虾从这笑中看出了悲凉与无奈。他听到这老头对自己说：“你刚才在我身后一直跟着，其实是想杀我吧！杀我的理由却仅仅是因为我收了你的卷，哪怕你并不记得自己在卷上答过了什么。 ~”那张卷上的内容果然从唐小虾的记忆中消失了，他也有些奇怪刚才为什么会起了滔天的仇恨，那真的只是一常考试而已啊，他有些迷茫的看着那老头，问他：“你到底是谁？”老头并没有回答他，他只是很神秘的一笑，笑的那么苦。他将头转向那对男女，颇有些无奈的对他们说：“看来，今天是非要我死了？”女很好看的一笑，并没有说话。倒是那男的很嚣张的说到：“纯真，你今天是再也没有机会了，看你老成这样，还有什么能力与我们作对？等消灭了你，这世界就全部是我们的了！”他哈哈的大笑了起来，笑得唐小虾很不爽。于是他便皱皱眉，他发现一直微笑着的妩媚女发现他皱眉便一下收敛了笑容，他看到那女轻拽了几下嚣张男的袖，小声说：“你正经点，“火神”可在这儿呢！”那嚣张男歪了一下嘴，将目光看向唐小虾，不屑道：“纯真的护卫们都已经被全数灭掉了，就剩下一个“火神”又能怎么样？”唐小虾的心中充满了疑惑，纯真到底是谁还有为这么这两个人称自己是火神什么的他完全没概念，不过有一点他似乎有点明白了，就是在那个嚣张男口中完全不值得一提的“火神”似乎就是他唐小虾，而这个叫纯真的老头因为护卫们被杀似乎已经陷入到极大的危机中了。他看了看嚣张男的健壮身体，又看了看自己的瘦弱身材。这要是平时，他唐小虾绝对是好汉不吃眼前亏的溜了，可嚣张男的狂妄语气让他无法控制的就走到了老头的身边。他是极其的讨厌恃强凌弱的！不知哪里来的信心，他在嚣张男和自己之间用手指在地上画了一条线，并对嚣张男说：“有本事你就过这条线试试！”唐小虾说得很硬气，他隐隐约约的明白自己居然是要保护身旁的这个老头的。那条线将唐小虾和老头与那对男女分成两边，看起来并没有什么特殊之处，可唐小虾不知从哪里来的信心，他相信那嚣张男绝对越不过这条线！一时间他居然有些郁闷，他从很多戏中看到的都是英雄救美的桥段，可他现在这么肯定，这么有信心，这么有男汉气概的举动居然是在保护一个胡都白了的老头！老头就老头吧！可这位年纪已经不小的老先生在敌人口中居然还有着一个那么嫩的名字，那嚣张男刚才管他叫的名字居然是“纯真”！真纯真啊真纯真！唐小虾不由自主的又看了看那已经白胡一大把的老头，他看到那嚣张男很不屑的一拳就打了过来，他的第一反应是要躲开，那么大的拳头要是打过来非把唐小虾打飞了不可。不过嚣张男的拳头在快越过唐小虾刚才画的那条线时则突然的舒展开了，他似乎想去抓唐小虾的领，他想把唐小虾提到半空好好的羞辱他一番！水，水一样的东西薄薄的立在那条线的层面上，那水是淡蓝色的，嚣张男的手在通过那层浅蓝色的**时迅速变得很慢。唐小虾看到那只手在通过那层**时居然被一点点的腐蚀掉了，被腐蚀的手上慢慢的流下了墨绿色的**。他看着嚣张男因为强忍疼痛而变得扭曲的脸，拥有力量的感觉让唐小虾忽然变得有些迷醉。妩媚女看到这种情景不禁失声叫道：“快把手抽回来，快！”嚣张男的手抽回去了，他似乎用了一些法术，已经扭曲变形的手上泛起蓝光，渐渐的恢复了原来的样。治好了手的嚣张男显得很不甘心，他很是不愿相信唐小虾随意在地上画了一道线就能阻止的了他，他像运气发功了一般，深呼吸了一下，唐小虾看他那只手渐渐的变成了红色，甚至还冒出了一些黑色的气体。嚣张男猛的将手握成拳飞快的打了过来，却还是又被那层**无情的减慢了速度，在淡蓝色的像形成水幕的**中他手上的红色渐渐消退，墨绿色的**再次从嚣张男的手上流了下来，“快收回来！”在妩媚女的轻吼中，嚣张男终于悻悻的放弃了。他再次用蓝光治好了自己的手，却因连续两次耗损功力而虚弱得居然吐出血来。嚣张男狠狠的看着唐小虾，气势上却弱多了。妩媚女又恢复了很轻松的神色，她对唐小虾说：“这次就先放过你帅哥，我们有七大护法，魔尊大人更是战无不胜，以后见面的机会还多着呢！”说完便轻巧的转身走掉了，嚣张男又恶狠狠的瞪了唐小虾一眼，也随着妩媚女走掉了。与刚才那种突然获得的超能力相比，唐小虾现在更关心的是事情的真相。他叹了口气问那老头：“这到底是怎么回事？”老头很平静的坐下，对唐小虾说：“给你解释的时间不多了，你只要记住，醒来后尽快找到一个叫洛思琪的女孩，并且买一本史记送给她。”唐小虾听得一头雾水，找一个吧认识的女孩儿哪有那么容易啊，他又不是警察，只是在他还想多问那老头几句的时候，四周却一下变得白茫茫了起来，接着他就什么都不知道了。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/laidaochunqiudangyueshen/1.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Prologue Ranwen Tang Xiaoxia's dream was in an examination room. He didn't know where the examination room was. He was surrounded by candidates who were busy writing. As a student, he couldn't help but hurry up and answer the questions. ~The questions on the paper were all kinds of weird, and it felt like many subjects were mixed together, but his answers were acceptable, but after calculation, he felt that the score was still two points away from passing. He had a few questions left blank. While he was anxious, the examiner smiled and handed him a thick dictionary. The examiner was a very kind old man with a white beard. Tang Xiaoxia felt that it was really not easy for him to be here as an invigilator at such an old age. He glanced at him gratefully, then quickly lowered his head to find the dictionary. He thought the dictionary would have the answer he was looking for, but after looking through it for a long time, he still couldn't find it. At this time, the handover bell rang. He sighed, thinking that he might not pass, but when he picked up the paper, he revealed the answer sheet underneath. It was a blank answer sheet, with names, test numbers, and answers to multiple-choice questions not written in. He grabbed the pen in a panic and tried to paint the card, but found that the papers were gone. The old examiner in the distance was holding all the candidates' papers and walked to the door and was about to disappear. For a time, various emotions filled Tang Xiaoxia's heart. He wanted to beg the examiner to return the paper to him and let him mark the card before taking it away, but he knew clearly that this was not possible. Inexplicably, a trace of hatred emerged from his heart. There was just a little bit at first, like a drop of ink dropped into a glass of transparent water, but it spread so quickly, and in an instant, the glass of water turned black. I'm going to kill him! Looking at the back of the old examiner, Tang Xiaoxia stood up in excitement and quickly chased after him. But this is not the end of the dream. Outside the examination room was a different scene. Tang Xiaoxia found that the examination building, which was very modern inside, looked so ancient after he chased it out. The examination building is surrounded by a dense forest and grassland, and the only way to the outside world is a long, endless winding path. (·~) The old man didn't go very far with the scroll under his arm. No one knew where he was going. Somehow, Tang Xiaoxia suddenly felt that this old man looked particularly vicissitudes of life. He walked very slowly, and his back looked particularly desolate. Tang Xiaoxia hesitated for a moment. He unconsciously slowed down and followed from a distance, neither getting closer nor letting the old man disappear from his sight. The old man finally stopped, and although Tang Xiaoxia walked slowly, he gradually approached him. Different from the overwhelming hatred that wanted to kill him just now, he actually became hesitant and hesitated whether to step forward. The feeling of wanting to kill him due to anger just now gradually changed. He couldn't explain what it felt like, and he always felt that something weirder would happen. Suddenly a man and a woman appeared. The costumes of these two people are very strange, just like people from the demon cult in costume dramas. The man looked to be in his forties, wearing a fiery red top. He was tall and strong, and looked particularly arrogant. The woman looked to be in her twenties. She was wearing a yellow dress, but her skirt was a little short, so short that it could not cover her knees at all. She was so beautiful, but there was a coquettish evil aura in her beauty. She could be said to be charming. She looked at Tang Xiaoxia charmingly, which actually made Tang Xiaoxia feel as if there was a deer bumping around in his heart, and his face turned slightly red. Tang Xiaoxia did not expect such an unexpected situation. At this time, he had already walked behind the old man. In this situation, he actually lost the idea of ​​​​causing trouble for the old man. He looked at the couple and felt a little guilty. He wanted to leave here, thinking that the couple looked like they were here to trouble the old man. One more thing would be better than one less thing, so he was ready to leave. The old man turned his head and smiled at Tang Xiaoxia. Tang Xiaoxia could see sadness and helplessness in his smile. He heard the old man say to himself: \"You were following me just now, but you actually wanted to kill me! The reason for killing me was just because I took your paper, even if you didn't remember what you answered on the paper. ~\" As expected, the content on the paper disappeared from Tang Xiaoxia's memory. He was also a little surprised about why he had so much hatred just now. It was really just a regular exam. He looked at the old man in confusion and asked him: \"Who are you?\" The old man didn't answer him, he just smiled mysteriously, with such a bitter smile. He turned his head to the man and woman, and said to them somewhat helplessly: \"It seems that you have to kill me today?\" The woman smiled nicely and said nothing. But the man said arrogantly: \"Innocent, you will never have another chance today. Seeing how old you are, what ability do you have to fight against us? Once we eliminate you, the world will be ours!\" He laughed loudly, which made Tang Xiaoxia very unhappy. So he frowned, and found that the charming girl who had been smiling suddenly stopped her smile when she noticed his frown. He saw the girl gently tug on the arrogant man's sleeves a few times, and whispered: \"Be more serious, the \"Vulcan\" is here!\" The arrogant man tilted his mouth, looked at Tang Xiaoxia, and said disdainfully: \"All the innocent guards have been wiped out, so what can I do if there is only one \"Vulcan\" left? How about it?\" Tang Xiaoxia's heart was full of doubts. He had no idea who Chun Zhen was and why these two people called themselves Vulcans. However, he seemed to understand one thing. The \"Vulcan\" that was not worth mentioning in the arrogant man's mouth seemed to be him, Tang Xiao Xia. And the old man named Chun Zhen seemed to be in a great crisis because the guards were killed. He looked at the arrogant man's strong body and then at his own thin figure. If this was normal, he, Tang Xiaoxia, would definitely be a good man and run away without taking the immediate loss, but the arrogant man's arrogant tone made him", "title_en": "Chapter 1"}